 The loop is able to be used from the outside of the seat cover. It is recommended to be used with the QUICKLOOP® loop fastener.\nThe QUICKFIT® hook fastener has a magnetic material that allows the operator to easily and quickly install it in the die set groove. The \"self- aligning\" feature of the QUICKFIT® hook fastener increases work speed and improves productivity. Self-aligning is a productivity-enhancing feature, and the QUICKFIT® hook fastener can be easily attached to the die set.","html":"<p>The QUICKFIT® hook fastener is an effective and efficient seat tie down system for automotive seats.<br>Its design accommodates curve lines and also provides long and joint-less seam lines.<br>Its excellent self-alignment capability helps shorten the time required to install. The loop is able to be used from the outside of the seat cover. It is recommended to be used with the QUICKLOOP® loop fastener.<br>The QUICKFIT® hook fastener has a magnetic material that allows the operator to easily and quickly install it in the die set groove. The &#34;self- aligning&#34; feature of the QUICKFIT® hook fastener increases work speed and improves productivity. Self-aligning is a productivity-enhancing feature, and the QUICKFIT® hook fastener can be easily attached to the die set.</p>"},"descriptionImage":null,"itemVariations":{"plaintext":"Straight & flexible types","html":"<p>Straight &amp; flexible types</p>"},"itemVariationsImage":null,"colorVariations":{"plaintext":null,"html":null},"colorVariationsImage":null,"colorVariationsPdf":null,"howToUse":{"plaintext":null,"html":null},"howToUseImage":null,"printableTape":null,"printableTapeNote":null,"recycledTape":null,"recycledTapeNote":null,"recycledMaterial":null,"recycledMaterialNote":null,"notice":{"plaintext":null,"html":null},"noticeImage":null,"parentProduct":[],"applicableSliderSameAsParent":null,"relatedProducts":[],"relatedCatalogs":[],"relatedVideos":[]}}]}}}